<section class="card"><h2>Weighted marks preview</h2><p>Each contribution = raw mark ÷ maximum mark × weight. Totals use unrounded contributions, displayed to two decimals. Pass requires CA ≥ 40% of its weight, ESE ≥ 40% of its weight (where applicable), and total ≥ 50. For CA-only modules the total must reach 50. Successful re-assessment is capped at 50.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="ac-bordered"><thead><tr><th>Student</th><th>ID</th><?php foreach($r['metadata']['components']as $c):?><th><?=e($c['name'])?> / <?=e($c['max'])?> (<?=e($c['weight'])?>%)</th><?php endforeach;?><th>CA</th><th>ESE</th><th>Calculated total</th><th>Final / 100</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($r['entries']as $v):$m=acMarks($r,$v);?><tr><td><?=e($v['student_name'])?></td><td><?=e($v['student_id'])?></td><?php foreach($v['marks']as $mark):?><td><?=e($mark??'Missing')?></td><?php endforeach;?><td><?=e($m['ca'])?></td><td><?=e($m['ese']??'N/A')?></td><td><?=e($m['raw_total']??'Incomplete')?></td><td><b><?=e($m['total']??'Incomplete')?></b></td><td><span class="badge <?=$m['result']==='Pass'?'good':'bad'?>"><?=e($m['result'])?></span></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></section>
